" dir=3D"auto">You can =E2=80=94 the file's already saved and downloadable.=
 Here's how to send it directly:</div><h2>Your side</h2><div class=3D"parag=
raph" dir=3D"auto">Download the file from our chat (it's attached at the en=
d of this message), then send it to your client <strong>as a document</stro=
ng> on WhatsApp =E2=80=94 tap =F0=9F=93=8E =E2=86=92 Document =E2=86=92 sel=
ect the file. (Don't send it as a photo/screenshot, or the code won't come =
through as a usable file.)</div><h2 class=3D"">Client's side =E2=80=94 what=
 to expect</h2><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"><strong>If your client=
 has an Android phone</strong> =E2=9C=85 works fine:</div><ol start=3D"1"><=
li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Tap the file in WhatsApp =E2=86=92=
 Download</div></li><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Open it =E2=
=86=92 choose <strong>Chrome</strong> (or any browser) when asked</div></li=
><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">The full website opens with all =
styling and animations</div></li></ol><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto"=
><strong>If your client has an iPhone</strong> =E2=9A=A0=EF=B8=8F it's awkw=
ard:</div><ul start=3D"1"><li><div class=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Safari =
on iPhone can't open local <code data-v-bfaabce6=3D"" data-v-048cb31c=3D"" =
class=3D"segment-code-inline">.html</code> files directly. The client would=
 need a third-party app (like "Documents by Readdle") or a computer to view=
 it properly.</div></li></ul><h2 class=3D"">One honest tip</h2><div class=
=3D"paragraph" dir=3D"auto">Direct sending works, but every time <strong>yo=
u</strong> change something, you have to resend the file and the client has=
 to re-download it. If you'll be iterating on this together, the free Netli=
fy link from my last message really is smoother =E2=80=94 the link never ch=
anges, and the client just refreshes to see updates.</div><div class=3D"par=
agraph" dir=3D"auto">But if it's a one-time send and your client is on Andr=
oid, go ahead =E2=80=94 attach it below and fire it over WhatsApp =F0=9F=91=
